WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:12.340
Resources & hours: staff, rooms, equipment and vehicles, each with hours, breaks and days off; plus the whole business's hours and public holidays.

2
00:00:12.889 --> 00:00:20.280
Click "New resource", pick the type and colour; if it keeps its own hours, turn on "Has its own hours".

3
00:00:20.825 --> 00:00:25.420
Add "Breaks" with "Add a break"; they repeat every day.

4
00:00:25.966 --> 00:00:31.920
Record leave or a day with special hours under "Days off & special hours".

5
00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:40.160
Public holiday dates are computed; confirm lunar ones with "Confirm date" or fix them with "Adjust date".

6
00:00:40.715 --> 00:00:48.490
Lunar holiday dates are approximate; confirm them every year so the assistant doesn't book or refuse on the wrong day.
